{"unit_id":"badai147__dsh-leafy-skin#feature-1","repo":"badai147/dsh-leafy-skin","commit":"a39351594036567f4c0013448a9756d090a2ad1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-leafy-skin 的功能「浅深模式绿色调色板」：覆盖 DSH 主题颜色 token，为浅色和深色模式分别提供绿系背景、文字、强调色和组件配色。插件客户端加载时自动应用，并随主题模式切换取对应颜色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:39-42","lib/client.js:496-499"]}
{"unit_id":"badai147__dsh-leafy-skin#feature-2","repo":"badai147/dsh-leafy-skin","commit":"a39351594036567f4c0013448a9756d090a2ad1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-leafy-skin 的功能「首帧背景染色」：在 Web 页面 index 注入表中加入背景 CSS，使页面脚本运行前和主题状态确定后都能显示匹配的浅绿或深绿画布。插件 Host 侧启动时自动注册该样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-30","lib/index.js:37-40"]}
{"unit_id":"badai147__dsh-leafy-skin#feature-3","repo":"badai147/dsh-leafy-skin","commit":"a39351594036567f4c0013448a9756d090a2ad1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-leafy-skin 的功能「界面细节样式」：客户端可选注入一层 CSS，为文字选区、交互控件过渡、菜单和弹窗入场、会话内容切换等添加样式。开关 ENABLE_CSS_LAYER 可关闭此层，保留主题 token 覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:30","lib/client.js:325-343","lib/client.js:475-499"]}
{"unit_id":"badai147__dsh-leafy-skin#feature-4","repo":"badai147/dsh-leafy-skin","commit":"a39351594036567f4c0013448a9756d090a2ad1a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-leafy-skin 的功能「启停清理」：客户端将主题 token 覆盖和额外样式分别交给 Cordis effect 管理；样式层在 effect 清理时移除创建的 style 标签，插件卸载或热更新后可撤销注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:475-499"]}
